## Description

This pull request introduces a style selection feature, enabling users to select a style, update the database with the selected style, and load the form with the selected style when selectedStyle is present.

## Changes Made

### FormUi.jsx

- Applied the selected style to the form by updating the inline styles based on selectedStyle.

```
 // ...Function imports

function FormUi({ ..., selectedStyle }) {
 
// ... sub-functions

    return (
        <form
            //...            
            data-theme={selectedTheme}
            style={{
                boxShadow: selectedStyle?.key == 'boxshadow' && '5px 5px 0px black',
                border: selectedStyle?.key == 'border' && selectedStyle.value
            }}
        >
       //....remaining functional code
}

export default FormUi;
```

### page.jsx

- Loaded and set the selected style from the database.
- Passed the selected style to the Controller and FormUi components.

```
 // ...Function imports

function EditForm({ params }) {
 //...
  const [selectedStyle, setSelectedStyle] = useState();

 //....

  const GetFormData = async () => {
    try {
      //...
      setSelectedBackground(result[0].background)
      setSelectedTheme(result[0].theme)
      setSelectedStyle(JSON.parse(result[0].style))

      //...
  }

  // ...

  return (
    <div className="md:p-5">
      
     // ...
          <Controller
            selectedTheme={selectedTheme}
            setSelectedTheme={(value) => {
              setSelectedTheme(value)
              updateControllerFields(value, 'theme')
            }}
            selectedBackground={selectedBackground}
            setSelectedBackground={(value) => {
              setSelectedBackground(value)
              updateControllerFields(value, 'background')
            }}
            selectedStyle={selectedStyle}
            setSelectedStyle={(value) => {
              setSelectedStyle(value)
              updateControllerFields(JSON.stringify(value), 'style')
            }}
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  )
}

export default EditForm;
```

## Testing

- Ensured the selectedStyle is correctly applied to the form's inline styles in FormUi.jsx.
- Verified that changes in the Controller update the database and reflect in the form.
- Validated that the form loads with the saved selectedStyle when selectedStyle is present in the page.jsx.

